# Agent behavior

## Builds

- Do **not** run Gradle/build commands (`assembleDebug`, `compile*`, `./gradlew`, etc.) unless the user explicitly asks
- Make the code change and stop — the user builds separately
- Do not “verify with a build” by default

## Chat style

- Cut to the point. No chitchat, preambles, or recaps of the ask
- Prefer 1–3 short sentences or a tight bullet list
- Skip “Here’s what I did”, praise, hedging, and filler
- Only expand when the user asks for detail or a failure needs a precise cause
